      "comment": "Four roots, newest cohort first: S3, S6, S4, S5. S7 is absent because it shares S6's cohort; S5 is present because its parent S4 was deleted LATER, in a different cohort — the #3818 precondition. Every token carries `deleted_at`, so a served live row or a root reported without its tombstone fails too.",
